        "@value": "The family a survivor-testimony pattern belongs to, as a literal. The values in use are classic_a (a canonical red flag), credible_b (a credible-lethal logistic signal), communication, recruitment, exploitation and deep_textual (extracted by deep-textual regex over press)."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/ratr-o#SurvivorTestimonyPattern"
